{"root":{"data":{"id":"dn1kndlvus00","created":1795333608222,"text":"深海基因组透明质酸降解与合成潜力挖掘"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn1kpfnkupc0","created":1795333769407,"text":"MAGs的分类纬度","expandState":"expand"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn1kxhay0m00","created":1795334399910,"text":"垂直梯度"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn1l6mnr3vs0","created":1795335116846,"text":" 表层-中层-深层-深渊-超深渊"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn1l81514xc0","created":1795335226729,"text":"水柱与沉积物分别统计"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dn1l13yqesg0","created":1795334684330,"text":"水平梯度"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn1l19bv5sw0","created":1795334696008,"text":"近岸-陆架-陆坡-远洋-海沟"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn1lewzb88o0","created":1795335766226,"text":"揭示降解酶的富营养依赖性"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn1l19qigmo0","created":1795334696893,"text":"在碳源极度匮乏的开阔大洋深渊中，HAS反而维持高丰\n度或高“合成/降解比值”，证明驱动它的是极端高压\n胁迫而非单纯的富碳环境。","layout_filetree-down_offset":{"x":-4,"y":-7}},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn1le7fcjgg0","created":1795335710599,"text":"排除陆源动物与致病菌的HAS合成DNA","layout_filetree-down_offset":{"x":0,"y":-15}},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dn1lfr1x73k0","created":1795335831687,"text":"生活方式"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dn1lftfu36o0","created":1795335836882,"text":"海洋雪/自由生活"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dn1lgvewz280","created":1795335919544,"text":"预期膜结合分泌型的 Class I HAS 高度偏向 PA 与沉积\n物从而发挥胞外屏障与粘附功能，而胞内可溶型的 snH\nAS-like在深海自由水体中占比高，发挥耐压作用"},"children":[]}]}]}]},"template":"filetree","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}